  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Developing viable projects that aim at increasing the current water supply to meet the growing demand of the targeted Districts for the next 15-20 years, protecting and better management of water supply infrastructure and their feeding sources, and enhancing the management of water supply schemes.</narrative>
